From 0215bf39fcc42c3d2e7722954700719d334faf6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fabien <fabcien@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 22 Nov 2024 16:43:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [chronik] Create a new optional JSON RPC interface

Summary:
This will be used to serve the result in an Electrum compliant way if possible.

Note that the Electrum protocol is not 100% compliant with the JSON RPC standard as it enforces the use of a newline as a delimiter.
This diff also updates ElectrumABC so it is compatible with both versions.

Test Plan:
  ./src/bitcoind -regtest -chronik -chronikelectrumbind="[::1]:50001" -chronikelectrumbind="127.0.0.1:50001"
then:
  echo '{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "server.ping", "id": "test"}' | nc 127.0.0.1 50001

  ninja all check-all

Reviewers: #bitcoin_abc, tobias_ruck, PiRK

Reviewed By: #bitcoin_abc, tobias_ruck, PiRK

Subscribers: tobias_ruck, PiRK

Differential Revision: https://reviews.bitcoinabc.org/D17185

Current-ABC adaptation (2026-10-14): Current ABC already implements the optional Chronik JSON RPC/Electrum interface. Preserve its implementation and carry only the original Dogecoin mainnet/testnet default-port delta (52002/64002). Regtest remains 60103; no API or wire format is changed.

Original-Commit: 7628506fd4bb2fd0345779c0fdb4c47b4c5d5c4b

diff --git a/src/chainparamsbase.cpp b/src/chainparamsbase.cpp
index c553821f3b44f091fc8fbd95e542e289d8aa4344..51883dd8f616a5fc1a55e8449307cbcf8425f129 100644
--- a/src/chainparamsbase.cpp
+++ b/src/chainparamsbase.cpp
@@ -45,13 +45,13 @@ std::unique_ptr<CBaseChainParams> CreateBaseChainParams(const ChainType chain) {
             return std::make_unique<CBaseChainParams>(
                 "", /*rpc_port=*/22555, 22557,
                 /*chronik_port=*/22554,
-                /*chronik_electrum_port=*/50002);
+                /*chronik_electrum_port=*/52002);
         case ChainType::TESTNET:
             return std::make_unique<CBaseChainParams>(
                 "testnet3",
                 /*rpc_port=*/44555, 44557,
                 /*chronik_port=*/44554,
-                /*chronik_electrum_port=*/60002);
+                /*chronik_electrum_port=*/64002);
         case ChainType::REGTEST:
             return std::make_unique<CBaseChainParams>(
                 "regtest", /*rpc_port=*/18443, 18445,
